        <rdf:Description xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:about="rdf:#01b58e17-0256-4f90-af5e-fe062e53696b">
            <rdf:value xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xml:lang="en" xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace">The model now runs in PCEnv to replicate the published results - we think!  The only question mark is over how the variables are expressed - as nM in the model and then as %s in the figures.  We're not sure why there's this difference.</rdf:value>
